Third-party data attribution
----------------------------

ss-now ingests and redistributes pointers to public data from:
USGS, NOAA (SWPC, SPC, NWS, CO-OPS), NASA (JPL/SDO/DONKI/EONET),
Iowa Environmental Mesonet (IEM) and Open-Meteo. Each view and API response
preserves the upstream source attribution; data licenses are listed per
source in the Sources tab of the application.
